WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.360 --> 00:00:09.060
You know guys Fortnite has really
become a phenomena. And a lot of you out there

00:00:09.060 --> 00:00:14.180
love the game, others not so much,
like me. But you know what I really hate

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:18.020
about Fortnite, is when some
disrespectful dude kills you and busts

00:00:18.020 --> 00:00:23.939
out the worm or dabs on you. I mean is a
dab even a dance? That doesn't make any

00:00:23.939 --> 00:00:28.170
sense. And what is this? What is that? What is the name for that? Why are we doing

00:00:28.170 --> 00:00:32.550
this list? This game isn't even an esport
yet. In fact, can we just do another like

00:00:32.550 --> 00:00:36.760
CS:GO Top 10 or something? I did- did you
just sprinkle salt on me?

00:00:36.760 --> 00:00:41.140
Here are the Top 10 Most Annoying Fortnite Dances/Emotes.

00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:49.440
We're starting off our list with a
throwback to the famous Carlton dance.

00:00:54.040 --> 00:00:55.620
This dance has made an appearance in

00:00:55.620 --> 00:00:58.900
countless video games, and Fortnite is
no exception.

00:01:07.220 --> 00:01:14.200
And while at first you may get hit with a rush of nostalgia, it’s not unusual for one to be tilted by this

00:01:14.200 --> 00:01:17.860
over the top dance move from Bel Air’s nerdiest son.

00:01:28.960 --> 00:01:34.060
You see a player ahead of you. No skin. No cover. Standing still.

00:01:34.740 --> 00:01:37.600
"We got ourselves a bogie, he's a default skin, which means bad."

00:01:37.840 --> 00:01:42.240
If that player turns on you he’ll likely bust out the ninth entry on our list.

00:01:45.220 --> 00:01:50.380
The base dance in Fortnite has its roots in the NBC show Scrubs.

00:01:59.500 --> 00:02:06.220
What could hurt more than being bested by a ‘frugal’ gamer who refuses to shell out V-Bucks for a slick dance.

00:02:16.640 --> 00:02:24.080
Sometimes Fortnite is exciting and the eighth most annoying dance on our list is the perfect way to show your appreciation for your own skills.

00:02:32.240 --> 00:02:37.780
The aptly named Jubilation gives you a chance to rub your happiness right in your opponents face.

00:02:46.780 --> 00:02:52.260
Whether it’s a victory royale, Elaine coming home from holidays, or beating the Texas Rangers

00:02:52.260 --> 00:02:56.920
this dance shows your victim just how happy you are to have bested them.

00:03:09.580 --> 00:03:14.460
The seventh dance on our list is the most obvious choice for those truly stylish plays.

00:03:24.620 --> 00:03:30.900
Dropping that sweet robotic pop after downing an enemy team certainly has a classy feel to it.

00:03:39.760 --> 00:03:46.480
And with all that mechanical proficiency on display, sometimes you just need to execute dance sequence.

00:03:55.420 --> 00:04:02.420
You may not be able to call our sixth entry a “dance” but it makes up for it in pure, rage inducing B.M.

00:04:15.900 --> 00:04:21.880
This emote lets you show your enemies that you know just how much they hated getting out played by you.

00:04:31.460 --> 00:04:39.000
If it’s one thing Fortnite has plenty of it’s Sodium Chloride, and no one is stopping you from spreading a little more.

00:04:53.440 --> 00:05:00.180
If you’re getting annihilated by a four man squad, you know they’re best mates when they all drop the number five dance.

00:05:07.560 --> 00:05:11.540
"Just perfect view to watch that whole thing buh. I'm just chilling in the tree, just kind of like."

00:05:11.540 --> 00:05:19.660
Popularized by Marlon Webb and his gang of outlandish joggers the Best Mates dance brings the energy to your best Fortnite moments.

00:05:33.360 --> 00:05:38.780
Fortnite has proven that it’s popularity can breathe life back into any meme.

00:05:45.360 --> 00:05:49.540
Flopping its way to number four is the funkiest dance on our list.

00:05:51.640 --> 00:05:58.980
When you really need to rub it in dropping this classic 80’s breakdancing move on your opponent's is sure to get in their heads.

00:05:58.980 --> 00:06:10.600
"Oh. I hate my life. Bro, bro they're doing the worm on me. Both of them. And they put a campfire here."

00:06:11.440 --> 00:06:13.740
"These guys are d**ks."

00:06:13.900 --> 00:06:18.660
Trying to pull this move out at your friends birthday party might not be a smooth move,

00:06:18.660 --> 00:06:22.100
but after the Victory Royale nothing could be smoother.

00:06:46.800 --> 00:06:52.160
The third place spot on our list belongs to the mesmerizing, arm flailing, floss.

00:07:03.640 --> 00:07:09.780
This dance has become a sensation after appearing on SNL and took the Fortnite community by storm.

00:07:14.640 --> 00:07:20.320
With it’s surge of popularity there’s no shortage of players flossing after an impressive kill.

00:07:38.560 --> 00:07:44.040
It’s simple. It’s effective. And it’s everywhere. Our runner up dance is the dab.

00:07:48.000 --> 00:07:54.240
Okay, maybe it’s dance status is a bit questionable but its social pervasiveness certainly isn’t.

00:08:08.640 --> 00:08:16.000
If you’re looking for the simplest move to send your enemies straight to tilts-ville then this needs to be your go to move.

00:08:27.600 --> 00:08:32.400
Every part of the dance that takes our number one spot screams annoying.

00:08:36.820 --> 00:08:39.580
From the music to the absurdity of the moves,

00:08:39.580 --> 00:08:44.720
it’s impossible to stay composed after losing a duel and seeing this.

00:08:53.200 --> 00:08:58.200
This blood boiling taunt is easily the most annoying dance in Fortnite.

00:09:13.320 --> 00:09:18.520
Oh yeah, it also may be the most recognizable Fortnite dance IRL,

00:09:18.520 --> 00:09:23.600
even before making an appearance in the 2018 World Cup Finals.

00:09:26.240 --> 00:09:31.920
That's our list for this week guys. And don't worry about Colin his sodium levels are a little bit elevated.

00:09:31.920 --> 00:09:34.900
But I'm sure he'll be back to
normal for next week's episode.

00:09:36.420 --> 00:09:38.780
It's not a dance Josh, it's not a dance.

